{"id":1449230,"shortDescription":"Glitchhikers es un viaje surrealista por los espacios liminales: un trayecto en coche de madrugada, un solitario pasillo de aeropuerto, un paseo por un parque vacío, un vagón en un tren nocturno... ¿A quién verás? ¿De qué hablaréis? ¿A dónde llegarás? Encuéntrate en el camino.","developers":["Silverstring Media Inc."],"publishers":["Fellow Traveller"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Subtítulos disponibles","Tamaño del texto ajustable","Comodidad de la cámara","Alternativas de color","Controles de volumen personalizados","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"31 MAR 2022","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756123138","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449230/ss_59a14afa2f07323f321c119bf0464b7a0a7d731b.600x338.jpg?t=1756123138","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449230/ss_59a14afa2f07323f321c119bf0464b7a0a7d731b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756123138"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449230/ss_4d1c7e47801f01f348482dd68b00204bc30849cd.600x338.jpg?t=1756123138","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449230/ss_4d1c7e47801f01f348482dd68b00204bc30849cd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756123138"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449230/ss_51f8a7a894835c3a73f2ffca8c1e4dfe8217afc9.600x338.jpg?t=1756123138","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449230/ss_51f8a7a894835c3a73f2ffca8c1e4dfe8217afc9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756123138"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449230/ss_0c683476838bfe5010448bef9f2bf39687241101.600x338.jpg?t=1756123138","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps